{"version":"1","id":"developercom","handle":"developercom","name":"Developer.com","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/a09e5f35b74b46698088f61cf9b693e1","description":null,"is_squad":false,"x":-5.0139,"y":2.7982,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":350,"newest_post_at":"2023-12-25T16:30:15.000Z","oldest_post_at":"2021-12-21T03:57:30.000Z","features":{"hype_score":0.0,"listicle_ratio":0.057143,"question_ratio":0.051429,"avg_read_time":5.874286,"summary_length_avg":332.198276,"title_length_avg":34.951429,"title_length_var":116.817641,"tag_entropy":4.24706,"tag_diversity":0.528571,"top_tag_share":0.211429,"avg_upvotes":4.902857,"median_upvotes":2.0,"avg_comments":0.237143,"comment_to_upvote_ratio":0.048923,"zero_engagement_share":0.302857,"viral_share":0.002857,"posts_per_week":3.370091,"non_article_ratio":0.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"recency_skew":0.104101},"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[4.3529,4.2059],"cadence_depth":[7.1471,0.0],"hype_variety":[-8.5294,8.5294],"title_style":[5.9118,8.5147]},"top_tags":[["java",135],["project-management",71],["general-programming",63],["tools",46],["python",44],["agile",31],["javascript",21],["performance",19]],"sample_titles":{"representative":["Best Flowchart Software for Developers","7 Best Developer Productivity Tools of 2022","Best Scrum Tools for Programmers"],"outlier":["How to Manage Visibility of Variables and Functions in Solidity"]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"3OdgRRfKW","title":"What Is the Role of a Project Manager in Software Development?","url":"https://www.developer.com/project-management/role-of-a-project-manager-in-software-development/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-is-the-role-of-a-project-manager-in-software-development--3odgrrfkw","summary":"Project managers play a vital role in software development by ensuring efficient project execution, meeting client expectations, and delivering high-quality software. They manage scope, resources, risks, and communication between teams and stakeholders.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/d194bd4b5d53308588e81208770013bc?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-12-25T16:30:15.000Z"},{"id":"VNIx7avNo","title":"Overview of the JAD Methodology","url":"https://www.developer.com/project-management/jad-methodology/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/overview-of-the-jad-methodology-vnix7avno","summary":"Joint Application Development (JAD) is a collaborative methodology used in software development to gather and define software requirements rapidly. It involves bringing stakeholders, developers, and users together in structured workshops called JAD sessions. The sessions are facilitated by a JAD facilitator and result in the documentation of detailed requirements and design for the software application. JAD offers benefits such as improved requirements gathering, increased collaboration, and reduced misunderstandings. However, it also has disadvantages, including resource intensiveness and potential for conflict.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/25143f7fc3cac7b9615c16162671bcc1?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-12-08T17:07:58.000Z"},{"id":"hLJcQNPdI","title":"How to Become a Project Manager in 2023","url":"https://www.developer.com/project-management/become-project-manager-2/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-become-a-project-manager-in-2023-hljcqnpdi","summary":"Project managers play a pivotal role in driving project success in software development. They oversee projects from conception to completion, ensure alignment with organizational objectives, and manage budgets and timelines. The average salary for project managers in 2023 ranges from around $80,000 to over $190,000 per year. A Bachelor's degree in a related technical field is commonly required, and certifications like PMP, CSM, and PRINCE2 are valuable. Familiarity with tools like JIRA, Trello, GitHub, Jenkins, and Slack is crucial for efficient project management.","image":"https://www.developer.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Asana-Project-management-tool.gif","num_upvotes":86,"num_comments":4,"created_at":"2023-12-05T01:46:05.000Z"},{"id":"sWL5JJtLi","title":"9 Best Scrum Alliance Certifications of 2023","url":"https://www.developer.com/project-management/best-scrum-alliance-certifications/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/9-best-scrum-alliance-certifications-of-2023-swl5jjtli","summary":"Scrum Alliance offers various certifications for Scrum Masters, Product Owners, and Developers to enhance their skills in agile and Scrum methodologies.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/1f161b29ebf95867868834e296c08494?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-12-01T03:27:57.000Z"},{"id":"9tkuuArrM","title":"Python Database Basics","url":"https://www.developer.com/languages/python/python-database-basics/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/python-database-basics-9tkuuarrm","summary":"Learn the basics of working with databases in Python using SQLite. Connect to a database, create tables, insert, query, update, and delete data. Also, discover best practices for working with databases.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4a7181f538409ee04b2b723324ddb763?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":9,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-11-28T15:59:28.000Z"},{"id":"fgC0IDec2","title":"Understanding Types of Thread Synchronization Errors in Java","url":"https://www.developer.com/java/types-of-thread-synchronization-errors-in-java/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/understanding-types-of-thread-synchronization-errors-in-java-fgc0idec2","summary":"Explore the types of thread synchronization errors in Java such as race conditions, deadlocks, starvation, and data inconsistency. Learn how to fix these errors by using synchronization mechanisms and proper locking strategies.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/9f8c36d3058f1e3265012fc9d79d0a79?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-11-17T20:31:26.000Z"},{"id":"f80gFhMZv","title":"Understanding Memory Consistency in Java Threads","url":"https://www.developer.com/java/memory-consistency-in-java/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/understanding-memory-consistency-in-java-threads-f80gfhmzv","summary":"Understanding memory consistency in Java threads is crucial for developing reliable and predictable concurrent applications. Java provides support for multithreading, but it also comes with challenges related to data visibility and ordering of operations. The Java Memory Model (JMM) defines rules and guarantees for how threads interact with memory, ensuring a level of consistency. The basics of memory consistency involve concepts like atomicity, visibility, and ordering of operations. In Java, synchronization mechanisms like synchronized methods/blocks and the java.util.concurrent package can be used to control access to shared resources and ensure memory consistency. Developers can also use practical tips like employing volatile, using thread-safe collections, and utilizing atomic classes for atomic operations to manage memory consistency effectively.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/9f8c36d3058f1e3265012fc9d79d0a79?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":12,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-11-17T16:19:40.000Z"},{"id":"Vc5tGZROb","title":"5 Best Online Courses for Agile Project Managers in 2023","url":"https://www.developer.com/project-management/best-online-courses-for-agile-project-managers/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/5-best-online-courses-for-agile-project-managers-in-2023-vc5tgzrob","summary":"Agile methodologies can help software development teams quickly adapt to ever-changing customer needs. Online courses for Agile project managers can expand skills, advance careers, and improve job security. Some of the best courses include Agile with Atlassian Jira, Google Project Management: Professional Certificate, and Scrum Master Certification Specialization.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c9c2deeefd2420671933e3dfbdc969c5?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":7,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-11-17T04:31:03.000Z"},{"id":"vpTREVO7h","title":"6 Best Online Courses for Agile Developers in 2023","url":"https://www.developer.com/project-management/best-online-courses-for-agile-developers/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/6-best-online-courses-for-agile-developers-in-2023-vptrevo7h","summary":"Discover the top online courses for Agile developers in 2023. These courses offer real-world, hands-on experience to help you gain confidence and get noticed by potential employers. Topics covered include Agile development, Scrum, Atlassian Jira, software development, and Agile planning.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c9c2deeefd2420671933e3dfbdc969c5?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":8,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-11-16T05:39:22.000Z"},{"id":"LAXI8zaDK","title":"11 Top ICAgile Certifications for 2023","url":"https://www.developer.com/project-management/top-icagile-certifications/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/11-top-icagile-certifications-for-2023-laxi8zadk","summary":"ICAgile offers a range of certifications for individuals and organizations to gain advanced Agile skills and knowledge. Certifications include Agile Fundamentals, Business Agility Foundations, and Leading with Agility.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/dc711ed9a6917dd4ca5e840eb0409007?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-11-16T04:37:05.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["rubydispatch","tuts_plus","metalbear","codemagic","bootcampuxdesign"],"opposite_handles":["felixrieseberg","hamelhu